<title>UK: BOE allots 1.14 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 1.14 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 1.14 billion stg of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of 1.65 billion.</p>
<p>It allotted 450 million stg in bills maturing on or before August 6 and 690 million in 6.75 percent repos to August 6.</p>
